  11.5pt;mso-height-rule:exactly&quot;&gt;&lt;span lang=&quot;EN-US&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposed floorspace for the first floor flat
  would fall below the minimum Gross Internal Area (GIA) space standards
  (notwithstanding the annotation) required for a 3 bedroom (5 person). As
